<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RM_Vorrel_Thoughts.xml                   LONGSHADE_RM_MOD_BUILD_1 step 2

  Moved and renamed from src/RimUtinni/AshkarrFlora/Defs/ThoughtDefs/
  RUT_Staggerseed_Thoughts.xml (RUT_VorrelEuphoriaThought ->
  RM_VorrelEuphoriaThought, hediff reference updated to RM_VorrelEuphoria),
  per §7 Q8. Content unchanged.

  The euphoria half of desert.md §4b, as mood. Situational
  (ThoughtWorker_Hediff), not a memory: §4b's euphoria IS the hediff running
  its course, so the mood has to track the hediff's severity down rather than
  sit at full strength for a fixed day after the feeling has gone. That is
  also the vanilla drug-high pattern (Core's Ambrosia, GoJuice, Smokeleaf
  thoughts are all ThoughtWorker_Hediff over their own high hediff).

  🔴 STAGE COUNT IS LOAD-BEARING. ThoughtWorker_Hediff picks this def's stage
  by the HEDIFF's current stage index (MEASURED from the decompiled engine,
  RimWorld/ThoughtWorker_Hediff.cs: ActiveAtStage(min(hediff stage, hediff
  stages-1, thought stages-1))). RM_VorrelEuphoria has two stages, so this
  has two, in the same order — "fading" first, "full" second. Add a stage to
  one and you must add it to the other, or every dose silently clamps to the
  last stage here.

  +26 at full is INVENTED-BUILD and deliberately above vanilla ambrosia: the
  ingredient kills anyone who eats it wrong, grows only in the water pockets,
  and takes a skilled cook — a mood payoff at ambrosia's level would not pay
  for the trip.
-->
<Defs>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>RM_VorrelEuphoriaThought</defName>
    <workerClass>ThoughtWorker_Hediff</workerClass>
    <hediff>RM_VorrelEuphoria</hediff>
    <validWhileDespawned>true</validWhileDespawned>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>vorrel afterglow</label>
        <description>It is wearing off, and I can feel exactly where the edge of it was. I am not sure I want to know how close that was.</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>10</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>vorrel bloom</label>
        <description>Something tried to grow inside me and did not make it. I have never felt better in my life and I am aware of how that sounds.</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>26</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

</Defs>
